{%- doc -%}
  PDP product pill.

  Uses the same expression the product card already uses, in
  snippets/product-card.liquid -

    product.type

  so the PDP pill and the card pill can never disagree: one source of truth,
  the product type. No metafield, no new logic, nothing hardcoded.

  Renders nothing when the product has no type, so a product without one
  shows no empty pill.

  Usage - a "Liquid" block at the top of the product information column:

    {% render 'pdp-product-pill' %}
{%- enddoc -%}

{%- liquid
  assign product_tag = product.type
-%}

{%- if product_tag != blank -%}
  <div class="pdp-pills">
    <span class="pdp-pill">{{ product_tag }}</span>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
